        },
        "Text": {
          "type": "cexolocstring",
          "value": {
            "0": "*A night later the fence's work is done: a slim, blacked blade that throws back no light.* There -- the Nightthorn. No relic of the Elder Days, mind; only patient steel for a patient hand. It won't glint at the wrong moment. You've walked the first of the quiet road -- keep to the shadow, friend."
          }
        }
      }
